// T3 Connect public configuration: the same identifiers as the repository-root .env.example
// (T3CODE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY, T3CODE_CLERK_JWT_TEMPLATE, T3CODE_RELAY_URL), which official builds embed. None of them is a secret.
// Point a build at another deployment by overriding these in the untracked Signing.local.xcconfig.
// The relay is a host, not a URL: xcconfig treats `//` as a comment. The app builds `https://<host>`.
T3_CONNECT_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY = pk_live_Y2xlcmsudDMuY29kZXMk
T3_CONNECT_CLERK_JWT_TEMPLATE = t3-relay
T3_CONNECT_RELAY_HOST = relay.t3.codes
